        "copy": "<p><em>Dr. Prendergast: </em>I am a huge advocate for supplements to combat aging, however in combination with testing whenever possible. On one hand, I see how effective they can be in synergy with aesthetic treatments. Our skin is an organ, and just like any other organ, it needs proper nourishment and protection. In fact, our skin often bears the brunt of the aging process. By understanding my patients genetic susceptibilities and nutritional deficiencies, I can optimize skin health and better combat the aging process.</p>"
